cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below and also cite the original CSLDV suite (see references)."
title: "pyCSLDV: Continuous scanning laser Doppler vibrometry in Python"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Python reimplementation of the CSLDV Vibration Measurement & Simulation
  Suite (Bartlett & Tarazaga, DOI 10.5281/zenodo.22032252, CC-BY-4.0),
  covering Lissajous scan design, virtual CSLDV experiments and ODS
  reconstruction by sideband demodulation. The original material has been
  modified; see the README for the changes. The initial implementation was
  written with Claude (Anthropic).
